{"id":44190,"date":"2025-08-29T07:52:50","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T06:52:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vouga-trail-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-10-22T21:48:47","modified_gmt":"2026-10-22T20:48:47","slug":"vouga-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vouga-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Vouga Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vouga Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Vouga Trail 2027<\/strong> (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se de <strong>8 a 10 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (sexta-feira a domingo), com centro operacional no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Sever do Vouga<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Sever do Vouga<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>). O programa estende-se por tr\u00eas dias com o <strong>Uphill Vouga 5 km<\/strong> (sexta \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong>), <strong>Trail Ultra 55 km<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado \u00e0s <strong>07:30<\/strong>), <strong>Trail Longo 38 km<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>), <strong>Vouga Kids<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>), <strong>Trail Curto 22 km<\/strong> (domingo \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>), <strong>Trail Mini 14 km<\/strong> (domingo \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>), <strong>Caminhada 12 km<\/strong> (domingo \u00e0s <strong>09:45<\/strong>) e o desafio de 3 etapas <strong>Green Stages 65 km<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos cruzam a riqueza natural de <strong>Sever do Vouga<\/strong>, percorrendo trilhos verdejantes, levadas hist\u00f3ricas, as margens do <strong>Rio Vouga<\/strong> e o <strong>Miradouro do Castelo<\/strong>, encaixados entre os maci\u00e7os montanhosos da <strong>Serra da Freita<\/strong>, da <strong>Serra do Arestal<\/strong> e do <strong>Lad\u00e1rio<\/strong>. Na sexta-feira, o <strong>Uphill Vouga<\/strong> liga a <strong>Senhora Dolorosa (Ribeiradio)<\/strong> ao emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Baloi\u00e7o Serra e Mar (Lad\u00e1rio)<\/strong> ao longo de 5 km com 550m D+.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o AZtrail<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Sever do Vouga<\/strong>, o evento disponibiliza t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, pr\u00e9mio finisher, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, abastecimentos e seguro desportivo. Prepara a tua estrat\u00e9gia de corrida na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 a 10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Sever do Vouga (Av. Comendador Augusto Martins Pereira), Sever do Vouga, Aveiro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255,