700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Uphill Vouga (UPV)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 8 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00 \u2022 550m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (23\/07 a 31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 26\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Vouga Trail<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 26\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Vouga Kids (500m a 2000m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 100m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rios de partida do Vouga Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vouga Trail decorre de 8 a 10 de janeiro de 2027 em Sever do Vouga (Aveiro), com centro no Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Sever do Vouga. Na sexta-feira (8 jan) parte o Uphill Vouga 5 km \u00e0s 16:00 (entre a Sra. Dolorosa em Ribeiradio e o Baloi\u00e7o Serra e Mar no Lad\u00e1rio); no s\u00e1bado (9 jan) partem o Trail Ultra 55 km \u00e0s 07:30, o Trail Longo 38 km \u00e0s 08:30 e o Vouga Kids \u00e0s 10:00; no domingo (10 jan) partem o Trail Curto 22 km \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Mini 14 km \u00e0s 09:30 e a Caminhada 12 km \u00e0s 09:45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis (D+) e tempos limite (cut-off)?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento contempla 8 formatos: Vouga Trail Green Stages de 65 km acumulados (3700m D+ em 3 etapas: 5 km + 38 km + 22 km), Trail Ultra de 55 km (2850m D+, limite 12h30), Trail Longo de 38 km (2100m D+, limite 8h00), Trail Curto de 22 km (1050m D+, limite 5h00), Trail Mini de 14 km (600m D+, limite 4h00), Uphill Vouga de 5 km (550m D+, limite 1h30), Caminhada de 12 km (400m D+) e Vouga Kids (500m a 2000m).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Vouga Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 2 fases (1\u00aa Fase de 23\/07 a 31\/08\/2026 | 2\u00aa Fase de 01\/09 a 26\/12\/2026): Green Stages 65 km (60 \u20ac \/ 70 \u20ac), Trail Ultra 55 km (40 \u20ac \/ 50 \u20ac), Trail Longo 38 km (34 \u20ac \/ 39 \u20ac), Trail Curto 22 km (24 \u20ac \/ 29 \u20ac), Trail Mini 14 km (18 \u20ac \/ 23 \u20ac), Uphill 5 km (10 \u20ac \/ 15 \u20ac), Caminhada 12 km (14 \u20ac pre\u00e7o \u00fanico) e Vouga Kids (inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 efetuada verifica\u00e7\u00e3o de material no controlo zero. Nas provas de Trail e Caminhada \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua, copo pr\u00f3prio (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos pl\u00e1sticos nos abastecimentos), manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, telem\u00f3vel operacional, casaco corta-vento\/imperme\u00e1vel e dorsal vis\u00edvel. No Trail Ultra 55 km \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m obrigat\u00f3rio frontal com luz.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Vouga Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o AZtrail (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o para a Pr\u00e1tica de Atividade F\u00edsica, Recreativa e Cultural) em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de Sever do Vouga.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Vouga Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-08\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Sever do Vouga (Av. Comendador Augusto Martins Pereira)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sever do Vouga\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 8\u00ba Vouga Trail 2027 realiza-se de 8 a 10 de janeiro em Sever do Vouga, Aveiro. Provas de 65 km, 55 km, 38 km, 22 km, 14 km, Uphill e Caminhada. Inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-vouga-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Vouga Trail Green Stages (3 Etapas: 5k + 38k + 22k)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/vouga-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Vouga Trail Ultra (VTU)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/vouga-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Vouga Trail Longo (VTL)\", \"price\": \"39.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/vouga-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Vouga Trail Curto (VTC)\", \"price\": \"29.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\",